---
description: Defaults for YAML files
globs: "**/*.{yml,yaml}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Do not put secret values in YAML. Name the GitHub Actions secret or Cursor environment secret instead.
- Keep `.cursor/config/bugbot.yaml` to the documented Bugbot keys: `version`, `triggers`, `review`, `prSummary`, and `autofix`.
- Quote YAML values that contain `:`, `#`, or leading wildcard characters.
